      "settings": {}, "blocks": {"where-do-you-ship": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "Where do you ship?", "body": "<p>We ship throughout the United States. If your state isn't showing at checkout, email us at <a href='mailto:hello@basenotescent.com'>hello@basenotescent.com</a> and we'll confirm coverage.</p>"}}, "when-will-it-arrive": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "When will my fragrance arrive?", "body": "<p>Your subscription shipment date follows the day you placed your original order. For example, if you ordered on September 4, you would receive your next shipments on October 4, November 4, and so on. New orders typically arrive within 1–3 business days of dispatch, and you'll get a tracking email as soon as your order leaves our fulfillment partner.</p>"}}, "shipping-cost": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "How much does shipping cost?", "body": "<p><strong>Monthly Rotation:</strong> free US shipping on every subscription order, with no minimum.</p><p><strong>One-time orders:</strong> free US shipping on orders of $33 or more. Under $33, standard US shipping is $4.99. Active Monthly Rotation members also get free US shipping on one-time orders.</p><p>If an order mixes subscription and one-time items, one-time shipping rates apply to that order. Your exact shipping cost is always shown at checkout before you pay. Full details are in our <a href='/policies/shipping-policy'>Shipping Policy</a>.</p>"}}, "change-address": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "Can I change my shipping address?", "body": "<p>Yes. Update your address in <a href='/account'>My Account</a> before your next scheduled shipment date to take effect for that shipment.</p>"}}, "returns": {"type": "faq", "settings": {"title": "Returns", "body": "<p>All sales are final. Because each fragrance is hand-decanted to order, we don't accept returns or exchanges, opened or unopened. If your order arrives damaged or leaking, or you receive the wrong fragrance, email <a href='mailto:hello@basenotescent.com'>hello@basenotescent.com</a> within 7 days of delivery with your order number and a photo, and we'll make it right with a replacement or a refund. Full details are in our <a href='/policies/refund-policy'>Refund Policy</a>.</p>"}}}, "block_order": ["where-do-you-ship", "when-will-it-arrive", "shipping-cost", "change-address", "returns"]
